oups through the United Brachial Plexus Network where you can talk to other families who have been through the same experience.\"\n\n**6. Establish partnership**:\n\"We are going to get through this together as a team — you, your son, our therapists, and me. I will see you every month, and you can call my office any time with questions between visits. You are already being an excellent mother by advocating for him.\"\n\n**Key principles demonstrated**: Direct absolution of guilt, medical education, parental empowerment, realistic prognostication, psychosocial support resources, continuity of care.',
